 family's  dragons had any Berry on their standing  it stands to reason that other families  in valyria maybe had larger dragons than  Valerian at its peak are quite a few  valerian-sized dragons so it's that's  the reason again that if the targaryens  had or used to have dragons of huge size  then their status would be of high Lords  but since they were only middle families  then even dragons of the size of  valerion would be average  there is also another factor to consider  here Valerian spent his later years in  King's Landings Dragon pit so if the  dragon pit truly limited dragon growth  in comparison to what it would have been  if they were allowed to live more freely  then valerian's growth rate in later  life would have been stunted whereas a  comparable Dragon living in Valeria  would not have been so restricted and  would have grown bigger and bigger with  the ambient magic that is present in the  place even the cannibal that was in  Dragonstone lived longer than valerion  and would maybe be as big or bigger but  since there were never any mentions  about his size this is still just a  theory of all the Targaryen dragons that  we know valerion was the only one who  was hatched before the targaryens left  valyria and he lived to be around 200  years old the other two dragons from the  conquest vegar and miraxis were not  nearly as big as Valerian at that time  but by the time of the dance of the  Dragons Vega was approaching the size of  the black dread but the strange thing is  that the dragons that were born in  Westeros always became smaller in size  every successive generation until blood  magic was performed again to give birth  to dany's dragons drogon rhaegal and  viserion which would have grown to quite  an astounding size given their fast  growth rate but were killed at a young  age but drogon is still alive and might  still be growing growing to be as big as  the black dread given his fast growth  rate  so the point is this imagine the  Valerian dragons at the peak of their  magic since Valerian was from valyria he  became the largest known Dragon Vega  which was born around 52 BC in  Dragonstone still had a lot of magic in  her jeans and so she grew to almost the  same size as valerion then the second  generation dragons like vermouth dream  fire and Silverwing were smaller than  Vega then we have the third generation  which were characters and melees and  they were of middle size the fourth  generation dragons like Cyrax were even  smaller this went on and on to the loss  of the Targaryen dragons grew to be the  size of a small doll  yet there is another story of valerian  flying off to valyria with area  Targaryen one of his writers what was  told is that the Doom kill of all the  Valerian dragons other than the  targaryens but there is a possibility  that there are other dragons who  survived without anyone knowing some of  which might have been elsewhere then  returned to valyria on Instinct just as  Valerian apparently did and lived there  without anyone on the outside world  knowing since Valerian was the biggest  known Dragon at that time and something  wounded him to the point of him not  returning to valyria again then there  might be something in valyria that was  bigger and badder than a black dread  maybe a larger Mina Valyrian Dragon had  survived the doom and gone back to  valyria and had met and fought Valerian  there but that doesn't explain what  happened to Aria which kind of looked  like radiation burns the Doom was some  sort of magical experiment that went  horribly wrong and in that case the  valyrians were probably in the middle of  something and whatever they were doing  were causing the Doom to hit it and  those monstrous things that were the  result might have caused the Doom anyway  the conclusion is this that there must  have been dragons bigger than Valeria in  the past owned by more powerful Valyrian  Dragon Lords but as to whether there  were still dragons in Valeria that is  